1023</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B6"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Krummenacker</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Paley</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Mueller</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Yan</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Karp</surname><given-names>PD</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Querying and computing with BioCyc databases</article-title><source>Bioinformatics 15961440</source><year>2005</year><volume>21</volume><fpage>3454</fpage><lpage>3455</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1093/bioinformatics/bti546</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B7"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Karp</surname><given-names>PD</given-names></name><name><surname>Ouzounis</surname><given-names>CA</given-names></name><name><surname>Moore-Kochlacs</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Goldovsky</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Kaipa</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Ahren</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Tsoka</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Darzentas</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Kunin</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name><name><surname>Lopez-Bigas</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Expansion of the BioCyc collection of pathway/genome databases to 160 genomes</article-title><source>Nucleic Acids Res 16246909</source><year>2005</year><volume>33</volume><fpage>6083</fpage><lpage>6089</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1093/nar/gki892</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Joshi-Tope</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Gillespie</surnam